{title: Boomi Enna Suthudhe}
{artist: Anirudh Ravichander Ethir Neechal}
{key: Fm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Fm] boomi enna [Bbm] suthudhe,        [Cm] oomai nenju [Fm] kathudhe
[Fm] en munnadi [Bbm] sukiran,        [Cm] kaiya katti [Fm] nikkudhe
damage aana [Eb] piece-u naane,        [Ab] joker ipo [Bbm] hero aane
[Fm] kaanja mannu [Eb] eeram annen,        [Ab] saanja thoonu [Bbm] nera aanen
hey [Fm] ennoda peru,        [Cm] seeraanadhey
hey [Fm] ennoda paadhai,        [Ab] neraana [Cm] dhe
hey [Fm] zero vum ippo,        [Cm] nooraanadhey
ada [Fm] nooraanadhey,        [Fm] santha pakkam [Bbm] pogalam
[Cm] panju mittai [Fm] vaang alam,        [Fm] beach pakkam [Bbm] pogalam
[Cm] ranga raatinam [Fm] suthalam,        [Fm] vaazhkai mella mella
[Cm] okay aanadhey,        [Ab] jodi vandhu ippo
[Eb] jolly aanadhey,        [Fm] bike rideu kuda
[Cm] happy aanadhe,        [Ab] kaalam vandhadhe
[Eb] gethu aanadhe,        [Fm] vaazhkai mella mella
