[Eb] jolly aanadhey,        [Fm] bike rideu kuda
[Cm] happy aanadhe,        [Ab] kaalam vandhadhe
[Eb] gethu aana [Bbm] dhe,        [Fm] engeyo [Ab] pogum [Bbm] kaathu
[Fm] ipo en jannal [Ab] pakkam [Bbm] veesum,        [Fm] en kuda [Ab] porantha [Bbm] sabam
ippa [Cm] thannaalaye theerum
